x27;s close, hold 5 / 10 trading sessions. Each stock is sampled no more than once every 11 US sessions; incomplete future outcomes are excluded. The company table uses that stock&#x27;s own history in its current score band, not the pooled mean. Fewer than 10 outcomes: no headline return estimate. Fewer than 20: thin sample; this threshold does not validate a forecast. Price returns use cached Bloomberg PX_LAST; dividend and corporate-action adjustments were not independently verified. The dashboard shows P10–P90 dispersion, calendar-block intervals and 2024–25 versus 2026 stability.</p><a style="color:#9dc0ff" href="http://DS-CAP-33:8080/wiki/_dashboards/attention-sentiment/score-returns.html">Explore score bands, dispersion and historical periods →</a></section></main></body></html>